# Bootstrap configuration. The real content lives in config.d/ fragments so that
# machine-local files can sit next to the tracked ones without touching this file.
#
# Included files are read here, at the top. OpenSSH keeps the first value it
# obtains for a keyword, so a local `10-local.conf` overrides the tracked
# `50-main.conf` for the same keyword.
Include config.d/*
